blurb = "The expression \"oya shirazu\" means \"not knowing parents\", and allegedly refers to the coastline in this area being unusually dangerous so that sailors (according to one source) or travelers on foot (according to another source) would forget about their own parents or children in the panic to survive incoming waves."
